    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d480">

                <pb facs="0554" n="466" sameAs="frus:frus1933v04/pg466"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">721.23/1060: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in the Dominican Republic</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Schoenfeld</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Santo
                                Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-02-08T13:00:00-04:40">February 8, 1933—1
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 2:35 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>5. My telegram 4, February 7, 8 p.m. Minister of Foreign Affairs is sending
                    telegraphic representation to Peru today specifically based on Kellogg Pact. Am
                    sending copy to Department by the next pouch.<anchor n="13" xml:id="d480-f1"/>
                    He confirms that Dominican Government has not received from Colombia, as other
                    signatory Governments apparently received, request to make representations based
                    on Pact for Renunciation of War.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Schoenfeld</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d480-f1" n="13" xml:id="d480-f1-content">
                <p>Transmitted in despatch No. 797, February 8, not printed.</p>
